# First Alliance ram from Veron Amberstill (Amberstill Ranch).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: the client files every racial riding spell under one Riding
# skill (SkillLineAbility), so any riding trainer of your faction teaches it:
# Apprentice Riding (skill 75) from level 40, Journeyman Riding (150) at 60.
# Blizzard: learning to ride grants a mount, and training costs 100g at 40 and
# 1,000g at 60 (Kris Zierhut). ItemSparse lists the
# mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60), usable by every race of the
# faction; whether a vendor still wants Exalted with another race's city (the
# Era rule) is server-side and unconfirmed.

step Learn to ride
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 40 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these.
  level 40
  train 4772                          -- Ultham Ironhorn, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Pick a colour
  tip Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 1261                         -- Veron Amberstill
  buy 5864 npc 1261 optional          -- Gray Ram, 20g
  buy 5872 npc 1261 optional          -- Brown Ram, 20g
  buy 5873 npc 1261 optional          -- White Ram, 20g
